Package: luci-app-upnp-client
Version: 1.3.0-2
Depends: libc, rpcd, luci-base, miniupnpc, miniupnpd-nftables, firewall4, curl, jshn
Section: luci
Category: LuCI
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local OpenWrt package
Description: Insanely useful relay sitting between upnpd and upnpc, in a double-NAT environment.
 Adds a manual "Request from upstream and forward to LAN port" feature,
 and relays UPnP/NAT-PMP requests from LAN devices to the upstream NAT router.
 Needs firewall4.
